          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 73147,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>2</code>'ye kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>2</code>'ye kadar olan sayılar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>counter++;</code> ifadesini <code>console.log(counter);</code> öncesine taşıyorsun. Döngü hangi sayıları gösterir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">1'den 3'e kadar olan sayılar.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">0'dan 2'ye kadar olan sayılar.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">0'dan 3'e kadar olan sayılar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">1'den 3'e kadar olan sayılar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code in the code block",
            "id": 73154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>1</code> ile <code>4</code> arasındaki sayıları konsolda görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter += 2;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter++;</code>, ardından <code>console.log(counter);</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>1</code> ile <code>4</code> arasındaki sayıları konsolda görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter--;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>0</code>, ardından <code>counter++;</code> ve son olarak <code>console.log(counter);</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
